  "description": "The image depicts a historical scene of slavery in the United States, specifically the brutal physical abuse of enslaved African Americans by white overseers. This historical institution was a foundational and deeply entrenched system of human exploitation and oppression that existed from the colonial period until its abolition in 1865. Understanding the context of American slavery is essential to interpret the image as a representation of systemic racial violence and dehumanization.",
